            "value" : "ファイル名"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For security, macOS runs apps obtained from the internet from a copy in a temporary location until you move them in the Finder." : {
      "comment" : "Translocation alert, 2nd paragraph",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOSは安全のため、インターネットから入手したアプリをFinderで移動するまでは、元の場所ではなく一時的な場所に置いたコピーから起動します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Forward" : {
      "comment" : "Help window toolbar: go forward (accessibility name)",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "進む"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Glow Ai - Notification" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Glow Ai - 通知"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Glow Ai can't be changed because it's owned by the system." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Glow Aiがシステムの所有になっているため、取り込めません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Glow Ai Help" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Glow Ai ヘルプ"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Glow Ai is in the Applications folder, but it was placed there without being moved in the Finder, for example by unzipping it there. Quit Glow Ai, move it to the Desktop in the Finder, move it back to the Applications folder, and then open it again." : {
      "comment" : "Translocation alert, 3rd paragraph (original location is inside the Applications folder)",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Glow Aiはアプリケーションフォルダにありますが、そこでZIPを展開した場合など、Finderで移動せずに置かれています。Glow Aiを終了し、Finderでいったんデスクトップへ移動してからアプリケーションフォルダへ戻し、もう一度開いてください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Glow Ai is running from a temporary location because it was opened right after being downloaded." : {
      "comment" : "Translocation alert, 1st paragraph",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ダウンロードした直後のため、Glow Aiは一時的な場所から起動しています。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
